flowchart TD
  A[Provider payload] --> B[Immutable raw bytes\nSHA-256 + query identity]
  B --> C[Versioned normalizer]
  C --> D[Point-in-time record\nevent · publish · available · capture]
  D --> E{available_at ≤\ndecision cutoff?}
  E -- No --> F[Quarantine\nNo feature access]
  E -- Yes --> G[Validated record set]

  I[Option instrument\nOCC deliverable version] --> J[Quote + trade]
  K[Underlying snapshot] --> L[Independent valuation + Greeks]
  M[Rate curve + dividend input] --> L
  J --> L
  L --> N[Volatility surface\nquality + arbitrage flags]

  G --> O[Immutable data snapshot manifest]
  N --> O
  P[Code commit + uv.lock] --> O
  Q[Schema hash manifest] --> O
  R[Experiment ledger + holdout seal] --> O
  O --> S[Reproducible experiment]
  O --> T[Public evidence\nschemas · checksums · diagnostics]
  B --> U[Private licensed rows\nOPRA or vendor data]

